  "schema": "eshkol.site-pages.v1",
  "_comment": "The one declared list of documentation pages the website publishes. scripts/build-site-content.sh renders every listed Markdown file that exists to site/static/content/<slug>.html, and generates the sidebar of each view (site/static/content/nav-<view>.html) and the published index (site/static/content/pages.json) from this list, so a page is added to the site by adding one entry here and rerunning the script; site/src/main.esk does not change. A listed file that does not exist yet is skipped with a warning when it is marked \"pending\": true, and appears on the site the first time the script runs after it lands. scripts/verify_site_release.py fails when this list, the generated fragments and the generated navigation disagree. A slug equal to the lower-cased basename of a release document registered in scripts/check_surface_counts.py is graded by that gate against tests/coverage/release_record.json.",
